### Available item
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/stock/mouse

### Unknown product -> 404
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/stock/headset

### Stock conflict -> 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/reservations/check
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"keyboard","quantity":10}

### Valid reservation check
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/reservations/check
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"keyboard","quantity":2}
